---
---

<section class="py-12 px-6 bg-primary-container text-pure-white relative overflow-hidden clip-slant-reverse mt-20 z-0">
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[150px] text-pure-white/5 absolute -bottom-10 -right-20 animate-float-slow -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">chat_bubble</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[120px] text-secondary-container/10 absolute top-[10%] left-[15%] animate-float-medium -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">forum</span>
	<div class="absolute -left-40 bottom-0 w-[800px] h-[600px] bg-pure-white/5 rounded-[8rem] rounded-bl-none -z-10 -rotate-12"></div>
	<div class="absolute -left-20 top-1/4 w-[500px] h-[400px] bg-action-emerald/10 rounded-[4rem] rounded-bl-none -z-10 rotate-12"></div>
	<div class="absolute -right-40 bottom-10 w-[600px] h-[500px] bg-secondary-container/10 rounded-[5rem] rounded-br-none -z-10 -rotate-6"></div>

	<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0MCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0MCI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMjAiIGN5PSIyMCIgcj0iMSIgZmlsbD0icmdiYSgyNTUsMjU1LDI1NSwwLjEpIi8+PC9zdmc+')] opacity-50"></div>

	<!-- Floating Decorative Elements -->
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[80px] text-pure-white/10 absolute top-[20%] left-[5%] animate-float-medium -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">sms</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[64px] text-secondary-container/20 absolute bottom-[15%] left-[40%] animate-float-slow -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">trending_up</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[96px] text-primary-fixed/15 absolute top-[30%] right-[5%] animate-float-fast -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">support_agent</span>

	<div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto relative z-10 pt-32 pb-20">
		<div class="text-center mb-24">
			<h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-pure-white mb-6 drop-shadow-md">Onde seus clientes realmente estão</h2>
			<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-primary-container max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg">Esqueça os formulários longos que ninguém responde. Leve suas pesquisas para o ambiente mais natural e conversacional.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
			<!-- Google Forms Mockup (The Old Way) -->
			<div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-pure-white/10 p-12 flex flex-col items-center filter grayscale-[50%] transform -rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500 bg-surface-variant/50">
				<h3 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface-variant/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-10 text-center flex items-center gap-3">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined">description</span> Formulários Tradicionais
				</h3>
				<div class="w-full max-w-md bg-surface-container-high/50 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-outline-variant/30 p-8 flex flex-col gap-8 opacity-60">
					<div class="h-10 bg-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg w-3/4 mb-4" style="background-color: #673ab7; opacity: 0.4;"></div>
					<div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
						<div class="h-5 bg-outline-variant/20 rounded w-1/2"></div>
						<div class="h-12 bg-surface-dim rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/50 w-full"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
						<div class="h-5 bg-outline-variant/20 rounded w-2/3"></div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-outline-variant/50"></div><div class="h-5 bg-outline-variant/20 rounded w-1/4"></div></div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-outline-variant/50"></div><div class="h-5 bg-outline-variant/20 rounded w-1/3"></div></div>
					</div>
					<div class="h-12 bg-outline-variant/40 rounded-lg w-1/3 mt-6 self-start"></div>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-10 font-body-lg text-body-md text-on-surface-variant/70 text-center max-w-sm">Frio, impessoal e com baixa taxa de conversão.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- WhatsApp Mockup (The New Way) -->
			<div class="whatsapp-bg rounded-[2rem] border-[8px] border-surface-container-lowest shadow-[0_30px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col items-center relative overflow-hidden transform rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 z-20">
				<!-- Glass highlight -->
				<div class="absolute inset-0 glass-highlight pointer-events-none"></div>
				<h3 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary uppercase tracking-widest mb-10 text-center flex items-center gap-3 relative z-10 font-bold bg-pure-white/80 px-6 py-2 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">forum</span> Mércure Elo Feedback
				</h3>
				<div class="w-full max-w-md bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-outline-variant/20 p-5 flex flex-col gap-5 relative z-10 h-[500px]">
					<!-- Header -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-4">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-pure-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-md">ME</div>
						<div>
							<div class="font-label-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface font-bold">Meu Ateliê</div>
							<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Conta Comercial</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<!-- Chat Area -->
					<div class="flex flex-col gap-5 flex-1 overflow-y-auto pt-4">
						<!-- Received Bubble -->
						<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-[20px] rounded-tl-sm p-4 max-w-[85%] self-start shadow-md">
							<p class="font-body-lg text-body-md text-on-surface">Olá! Temos algumas perguntas rápidas sobre sua última compra. Podemos começar?</p>
							<div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant text-right mt-2 font-medium">11:13</div>
						</div>
						<!-- Sent Bubble -->
						<div class="bg-secondary-container/50 border border-secondary/20 rounded-[20px] rounded-tr-sm p-4 max-w-[85%] self-end shadow-md">
							<p class="font-body-lg text-body-md text-on-surface font-medium">Claro! Vamos lá.</p>
							<div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant text-right mt-2 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 font-medium">11:14 <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">done_all</span></div>
						</div>
						<!-- Received Bubble -->
						<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-[20px] rounded-tl-sm p-4 max-w-[85%] self-start shadow-md">
							<p class="font-body-lg text-body-md text-on-surface">Como você avalia a qualidade do acabamento do produto? (1 a 5)</p>
							<div class="flex gap-3 mt-4">
								<button class="bg-[#e7fce3] text-[#075e54] border border-[#25d366]/30 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold shadow-sm hover:bg-[#25d366]/10 transition-colors">1</button>
								<button class="bg-[#e7fce3] text-[#075e54] border border-[#25d366]/30 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold shadow-sm">...</button>
								<button class="bg-[#25d366] text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-[#128c7e] transition-colors">5</button>
							</div>
							<div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant text-right mt-2 font-medium">11:14</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-8 font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary text-center max-w-sm relative z-10 font-bold bg-pure-white/80 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">Interativo, familiar e com taxas de resposta até 4x maiores.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
